  "instructions": [
    "1. Heat 1 tablespoon of avocado oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "2. Add the shrimp and cook for 2-3 minutes per side, until pink and cooked through.",
    "3. Warm the tortillas by wrapping them in a damp paper towel and microwaving for 20-30 seconds.",
    "4. Assemble the tacos by placing a cooked shrimp on each tortilla, followed by a squeeze of lime juice, a sprinkle of cumin and chili powder, and a sprinkle of salt and pepper.",
    "5. Garnish with chopped cilantro and serve immediately."
